{
  "itemGroup.item_sink": "Create: Thing Sink",
  "block.item_sink.item_sink": "Thing Sink",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.header": "Working the Thing Sink",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_1": "Thing Sinks turn unwanted things into geld, one thing for each work round.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_2": "Right-click to open the workgear. Put a fitting thing in the ingoing slot on the left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_3": "Only set-up things with a ready geld yield are taken in. With JEI, look up the Thing Sink's exchange craftings.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_4": "At first, the Thing Sink needs Forge Energy (FE) from a power maker or store. Power may come in from any side; its bar is on the left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_5": "The workgear lights up while working. The headway arrow fills as it spends FE. A thing's worth sets the work time and FE need.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_6": "Take the geld from the two outgoing slots on the right. Each finished work round spends one ingoing thing.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_7": "The first-set yields are Create: Numismatics coins. Without Numismatics, set outputItem to a thing in your game, such as minecraft:emerald, in item_sink-common.toml.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.header": "Self-Working Thing Sinks",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_1": "Feed fitting things into the Thing Sink with a hopper. This chest and hopper fill the ingoing slot from above.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_2": "A further hopper draws geld into a chest. It takes only from the two outgoing slots, so unworked things stay within.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_3": "Keep FE flowing while the workgear runs. Thing input, geld withdrawal and FE input work on every side.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_4": "Work stops when there is no room for the next yield or when FE runs out. Keep the outgoing slots clear and the workgear powered.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_5": "Once there is room for the geld and enough FE, the work starts anew by itself.",
  "jei.item_sink.item_sink_conversion": "Thing Swapping",
